{
  "card": "docs/baseline/rule-cards/evidence-mastery.md",
  "status": "草稿",
  "rule_version": "R01-r1",
  "notes": [
    "kind 表示测哪段规则：strength＝单条证据定级（R1–R5）；mastery＝一个知识点的档位派生（R6–R17、R21）；target＝目标档（R18）；map_stats＝地图上的数（R19、R20）。",
    "expect 里列出的字段都要相等，没列的不检查；score 允许 0.001 的误差。",
    "参数取 params 的值，与 contracts/params.yaml 现值相同；只有 credibility_caps 的四级按规则卡写成 none（不记），见规则卡出入表第 1 条。proposed_params 是建议新增、待整合任务登记的参数。",
    "带 decision 的例子取决于拍板问题：decided 里是已拍板的，temp_decisions 里是还没拍板、按推荐临时写的；改了哪条，就改卡、改这里、改测试，同一次提交。",
    "mastery 的 evidence 按写入账本的先后排列。没写的字段取默认：type＝single、kps＝1、source＝practice、confidence＝sure、at_h＝0（作答时间，单位小时）。reason＝这条证据的原因代码，判断“把握度关闭时只因关闭才记成中”要用；revoked＝已撤回；inherited＝拆分时按映射继承来的；batch＝同一次自评检验的题。",
    "取值代码：strength 用 strong、medium、weak、negative、pending、none（none＝不记）；confidence 用 sure、vague、guess、off、none；credibility 用 reviewed、own、generated_confirmed、generated_instant；题型与知识类型用 docs/product/glossary.yaml 的代码。"
  ],
  "params": {
    "learner.evidence.strength_weights": {
      "strong": 1.0,
      "medium": 0.6,
      "weak": 0.3,
      "negative": -1.0
    },
    "learner.evidence.credibility_caps": {
      "reviewed": "strong",
      "own": "strong",
      "generated_confirmed": "medium",
      "generated_instant": "none"
    },
    "learner.evidence.fast_answer_ratio": 0.3,
    "learner.evidence.min_for_sufficient": 2,
    "learner.mastery.level_thresholds": [1.0, 2.5, 4.5, 7.0, 10.0],
    "learner.verify.recheck_after_hours": 24,
    "learner.mastery.cross_check_items": 2,
    "learner.self_check.items": 2,
    "learner.memory.min_rating_seconds": 1.5
  },
  "proposed_params": {
    "learner.mastery.default_target_by_type": {
      "concept": 3,
      "fact": 2,
      "statute": 3,
      "procedure": 4,
      "application": 4,
      "essay": 4,
      "oral": 4,
      "practical": 4,
      "accumulation": null,
      "untyped": 3
    },
    "learner.mastery.apply_question_types": ["material", "calculation", "short_answer", "essay", "oral", "practical"],
    "learner.mastery.transfer_min_kps": 2,
    "learner.mastery.weak_gap_levels": 2,
    "learner.mastery.drop_buffer": 1.0
  },
  "decided": {
    "R01-Q4": "B",
    "R01-Q7": "B"
  },
  "temp_decisions": {
    "R01-Q1": "C",
    "R01-Q2": "B",
    "R01-Q3": "B",
    "R01-Q5": "A",
    "R01-Q6": "A"
  },
